**Bus factor is 1.** One author, Andrew Gallant, wrote 2554 of the 4205 lines in `src/` that still exist, which is 60.7%.

I used `git blame -w -M -C` on HEAD across the 8 files in `src/`. The `-w` flag stops the line-ending fix in `error.rs` from taking ownership of those lines. I merged author names that were clearly the same person: `Niv Kaminer` and `nivkner`, `Ola Berg` and `ola.berg`, `Alisha` and `Alisha Aneja`.

| Author | Surviving lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
